=== SPECTRAL FLATNESS ===
Among regular n=7:
  H=189 (Paley): eigenvalues all |lambda|=sqrt(7)=2.646
    -> tr(S^4) = 294 = MINIMUM kurtosis
  H=175: three distinct magnitudes -> tr(S^4) = 742
  H=171: three distinct magnitudes -> tr(S^4) = 486

SPECTRAL FLATNESS PRINCIPLE: min kurtosis <=> max H for regular
